CHANGE_2FA_BACK_EN=<tg-emoji emoji-id="6005570495603282482">🔐</tg-emoji> Change 2FA\n\nChanges 2FA for your uploaded accounts in batch.\nSome numbers carry no json file — do you need to enter the original password?\nPS: the program can read the json inside the zip itself; if the number contains this info, just click "no input needed".\nPS: for numbers that had a password reset and are over a week old, this will set the new password.

CHANGE_2FA_BACK_TW=<tg-emoji emoji-id="6005570495603282482">🔐</tg-emoji> 修改2FA\n\n修改2FA:您上傳的帳號將批次修改2FA。\n鑑於很多號碼並不攜帶json檔案，您是否需要輸入號碼的原始密碼？\nPS: 程式可以自行讀取號碼壓縮包內的json檔案，如果號碼包含這些資訊，點擊無需輸入即可）\nPS: 如果是發送過密碼重置的號碼，且超過一星期，此功能將重置密碼為新密碼

