PASSKEY_BACK_EN=<tg-emoji emoji-id="6008118472066732010">📦</tg-emoji> Passkey Tool\n\nCreates Passkey archives for your uploaded accounts.\n<tg-emoji emoji-id="5877332341331857066">📁</tg-emoji>Choose a direction to begin.

PASSKEY_BACK_TW=<tg-emoji emoji-id="6008118472066732010">📦</tg-emoji> Passkey工具\n\nPasskey工具:您上傳的帳號將製作Passkey的壓縮包。\n<tg-emoji emoji-id="5877332341331857066">📁</tg-emoji>請開始選擇方向。

REGTIME_BACK_EN=<tg-emoji emoji-id="5900104897885376843">📦</tg-emoji> Registration Time\n\nExtracts registration time and categorizes by date.\n<tg-emoji emoji-id="5877332341331857066">📁</tg-emoji>Upload files containing .session and .json.

REGTIME_BACK_TW=<tg-emoji emoji-id="5900104897885376843">📦</tg-emoji> 註冊時間\n\n註冊時間:您上傳的帳號將提取註冊時間並按日期分類。\n<tg-emoji emoji-id="5877332341331857066">📁</tg-emoji>請開始上傳包含 .session 和 .json 檔案的檔案
